    {"id":"card-explore-solutions","type":"text","x":40,"y":70,"width":320,"height":330,"text":"## 探索成熟方案\n\n`公开` `Prompt` `仅显式调用`\n\n先看成熟方案与完整选项空间，再决定是否实现。包含前提、成本、关系与切换条件。\n\n**调用**\n`$prompt-explore-solutions`\n\n[[public/skills/prompt-explore-solutions/SKILL|打开原内容 →]]"},
    {"id":"card-effect-whitebox","type":"text","x":400,"y":70,"width":320,"height":330,"text":"## 效果白盒拆解\n\n`公开` `Prompt` `仅显式调用`\n\n把已经实现的效果拆成核心原理、技术骨架、流程和可复用心智模型。\n\n**调用**\n`$prompt-effect-whitebox`\n\n[[public/skills/prompt-effect-whitebox/SKILL|打开原内容 →]]"},
