    {"id":"card-background-removal","type":"text","x":840,"y":70,"width":300,"height":330,"text":"## 去背景技术复刻\n\n`公开` `图像处理` `GPU`\n\n主链路：RMBG-2.0 / BiRefNet 粗分割 → VITMatte 边缘精修。\n\n**运行条件**\nComfyUI · CUDA GPU\n\n[[public/modules/background-removal/README|打开说明 →]]\n[[public/modules/background-removal/workflows/birefnet-rmbg2-vitmatte-api.json|打开工作流 JSON →]]"}
